# Go import paths: `go get anetos.dev/anetos/...` asks
# https://anetos.dev/anetos/...?go-get=1 for the go-import meta tag, which
# names the repository. Every package path under a module gets the
# module's page (a rewrite: the address stays, the status is 200).
/anetos /go/anetos/ 200
/anetos/* /go/anetos/ 200
/locales /go/locales/ 200
/locales/* /go/locales/ 200

# Shortcuts
/docs https://docs.anetos.dev/ 302
/docs/* https://docs.anetos.dev/:splat 302
/github https://github.com/anetos-dev/anetos 302
